OL,3,GNEWSA'It took years to get
OL,4,Apain-relieving surgery - I hope a robot
OL,5,Ameans others won't have to wait'
OL,6,
OL,7,FLike thousands of women in Northern
OL,8,FIreland, Colleen Crothers waited
OL,9,Fdecades for medical help to treat
OL,10,Fchronic endometriosis - and, now thanks
OL,11,Fto an all-island first, she's hoping
OL,12,Fher long road will be a thing of the
OL,13,Fpast.
OL,15,F"Robotic surgery came too late for me,"
OL,16,Fshe said. "I hope other women won't
OL,17,Fhave to wait as long."
OL,19,FShe is talking about a new breakthrough
OL,20,Ffor female patients in Northern Ireland
OL,21,F- the da Vinci gynae robot at Belfast
OL,22,FCity Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
