OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'It took years to get
OL,4,Apain-relieving surgery - I hope a robot
OL,5,Ameans others won't have to wait'
OL,6,
OL,7,FOperated by humans, the robot's wrists
OL,8,Fcan twist and turn in tight pelvic
OL,9,Fspaces and it is said to be more
OL,10,Fprecise at complex surgery than a human
OL,11,Fhand because it is steadier.
